# Having the color or quality of [[gold]].
# Made of gold or covered by a thin layer of gold.
# Having a falsely pleasant appearance; [[sugarcoat]]ed.
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Merchant of Venice|II|7|text=All that [[glister]]s is not gold;<br>Often have you heard that told:<br>Many a man his life hath sold<br>But my outside to [[behold]]:<br>'''Gilded''' tombs do worms [[infold]].<br>Had you been as wise as bold,<br>Young in limbs, in judgement old,<br>Your answer had not been inscroll'd:<br>[[fare|Fare]] you well; your [[suit]] is cold.}}

